<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Sunday's match:</p>
<p>10 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>9 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>8 - Anton Drobnjak (Bastia), Miladin Becanovic (Lille)</p>
<p>7 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Leonardo (Paris SG)</p>
<p>6 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes)</p>
<p>5 - Sonny Anderson (Monaco), Christopher Wreh (Guingamp)</p>
<p>4 - Lubomir Moravcik (Bastia), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux),</p>
<p>Mohammed Chaouch (Nice), Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille).</p>
</text>
